my $CODE = <<'END_CODE';
foo bar foo baz foo
END_CODE

{
    desc => q{// repeats the last search},
    description => <<'END_DESC',
## Macro: `xt/visual/macros/search_empty_pattern`

After a previous search, **//** (empty pattern with slashes) repeats the last search pattern, equivalent to pressing `n`.

**Keys:** `/bar\n` then `//\n`

**initial.png**
- Cursor at line 1, col 0
- Line: `foo bar foo baz foo`

**after_first_search.png**
- Cursor on "bar" at col 4 after `/bar`

**after_double_slash.png**
- `//` repeated the last search pattern "bar"
- Cursor position depends on implementation (may wrap or show "already at last match")
END_DESC
    run => sub {
        my ($ctx) = @_;
        $ctx->buffer->set_text($CODE);
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->snapshot('initial');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('/bar\n');
        $ctx->delay(300);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_first_search');
        $ctx->delay(100);
        $ctx->keys('/\n');
        $ctx->delay(300);
        $ctx->snapshot('after_double_slash');
    },
}
